[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="PartAssembly" format=3]
; The Limpet: a domed mag-tank clinging to metal on two treads, a prayer wheel on its back and a
; drill under its brow. Origin on the surface it clings to. Joints: X forward, Y up (away from
; the surface), Z toward the camera.

